WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:12.220
We can use traditional techniques,

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.940
what we are calling now circular design

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.800
to make natural dyes.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.480
We've experimented with kola nuts,

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.263
we've experimented with roots.

00:00:21.164 --> 00:00:25.750
What's also important
is you get like the old,

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.890
the young, and then the future together.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.410
When I think about it in context

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:33.160
in Malawi in itself, we
do have different types

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.930
of traditional methods,
but I feel right now

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.120
things are not being passed
on as they should be.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.910
That's what our work is about.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:46.370
What I noticed, it's the
problems of skills transfer.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:48.450
We started the cooperative of women

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:49.540
in a town called Makeni.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:50.920
This is like the headquarter town

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.330
for tie-dye in Sierra Leone.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:55.780
And I thought, where
best to start this work.

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:59.500
We are using it as a means
to teach the young people.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.900
I think it's important really
just to bring it all back.

00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:07.030
Let us remain circular,
you know what I mean?

00:01:07.030 --> 00:01:12.030
If we're able to, get
communities involved,

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:15.547
it would not only unite
them as a community

00:01:15.547 --> 00:01:18.670
but it also encourages
that circular process.

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:21.440
Yes, we've actually done
community cleanups as well,

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:23.210
we're working with the city council,

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:25.250
it's really always a
great idea and initiative.

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.083
- Yeah.

00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:28.250
As the community, we are
supposed to be responsible

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:33.250
for the waste that we are
throwing out into our environment.

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:39.140
So how can you get the
community also to just change

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:43.293
the way of thinking about waste?

